[center]
[size=6][b][color=#42ACC8]Skyrim Fitting System v1.5.4[/color][/b][/size]
[/center]

[list]
[*]Fixed a v1.5.3 startup crash or endless wait before the main menu with older RaceMenu versions.[/*]
[*]Corrected version-specific RaceMenu interface handling for live BodyMorph and registered high heels. Unverified interfaces are skipped safely.[/*]
[*]Fixed failure handling for legacy RaceMenu high-heel updates.[/*]
[*]Expanded compatibility tests while preserving actor isolation, DAVE/DAV/native, strip/redress linking, appearance locks, and dye behavior.[/*]
[/list]

No separate RaceMenu patch is required.

Developer details: [url=https://github.com/compilecraftworks/SkyrimFittingSystem/blob/main/docs/RaceMenu-ABI-Audit.md]RaceMenu ABI audit[/url].
